From 01fb6b55a167fcc57ed7a0595f70be8c23e45e55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:58:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gitio): edit stops, runner waits on git not pipes; one
 naming path

Edit stop = amend with edit last in done; a merge there is its own
stop; squash/fixup conflicts stay replays; editor steps count the
stopped step. run_to_end no longer hangs on a hook's background job.

Refs #1336-#1348
